{"id":"acdc33a870c76337","group":"58","path":"58/batch15/58-thm-relative-constructibility.md","title":"Relative Constructibility","display":"thm-relative-constructibility — Relative Constructibility","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-relative-constructibility","aliases":["58-thm-relative-constructibility"],"display":"thm-relative-constructibility — Relative Constructibility","depends_on":["[[../batch03/58-df-zfc-inner3-relative-constructible-universe.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-relative-constructibility"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-relative-constructibility</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-relative-constructibility — Relative Constructibility"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"7fffbf0fc82b6138\" href=\"?note=7fffbf0fc82b6138\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-zfc-inner3-relative-constructible-universe.md\">../batch03/58-df-zfc-inner3-relative-constructible-universe.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\operatorname{Ord}\">\\(A\\subseteq\\operatorname{Ord}\\)</span> (predicate parameter)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ord}\">\\(\\operatorname{Ord}\\)</span> (class of ordinals)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ordinal}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ordinal}\\)</span> (set-ordinal predicate supplied by the upstream hierarchy definition)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle L_\\alpha[A]:\\alpha\\in\\operatorname{Ord}\\rangle\">\\(\\langle L_\\alpha[A]:\\alpha\\in\\operatorname{Ord}\\rangle\\)</span> (relative constructible hierarchy)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcInner3RelativeConstructibleUniverse}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcInner3RelativeConstructibleUniverse}_S\\)</span> (membership predicate for <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L[A]\">\\(L[A]\\)</span>, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"7fffbf0fc82b6138\" href=\"?note=7fffbf0fc82b6138\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-zfc-inner3-relative-constructible-universe.md\">../batch03/58-df-zfc-inner3-relative-constructible-universe.md</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}relative\\text{-}constructibility} \\vdash A\\subseteq\\operatorname{Ord}\\to\\forall x\\in V\\;\\left(\\mathrm{ZfcInner3RelativeConstructibleUniverse}_S(x,A)\\leftrightarrow\\exists\\alpha\\in V\\;(\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\land x\\in L_\\alpha[A])\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}relative\\text{-}constructibility} \\vdash A\\subseteq\\operatorname{Ord}\\to\\forall x\\in V\\;\\left(\\mathrm{ZfcInner3RelativeConstructibleUniverse}_S(x,A)\\leftrightarrow\\exists\\alpha\\in V\\;(\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\land x\\in L_\\alpha[A])\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The displayed equivalence is the set-level interpretation of the class identity <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L[A]=\\bigcup_{\\alpha\\in\\operatorname{Ord}}L_\\alpha[A]\">\\(L[A]=\\bigcup_{\\alpha\\in\\operatorname{Ord}}L_\\alpha[A]\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>For ordinal predicate <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span>, this is constructibility relative to <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> as a predicate; it does not treat either <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ord}\">\\(\\operatorname{Ord}\\)</span> or <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L[A]\">\\(L[A]\\)</span> as a set.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch03/58-df-zfc-inner3-relative-constructible-universe.md","status":"resolved","id":"7fffbf0fc82b6138","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-df-zfc-inner3-relative-constructible-universe.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch03/58-df-zfc-inner3-relative-constructible-universe.md","status":"resolved","id":"7fffbf0fc82b6138","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcInner3RelativeConstructibleUniverse}_S$ (membership predicate for $L[A]$, see [[../batch03/58-df-zfc-inner3-relative-constructible-universe.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A\\subseteq\\operatorname{Ord}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Ord}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ordinal}","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle L_\\alpha[A]:\\alpha\\in\\operatorname{Ord}\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcInner3RelativeConstructibleUniverse}_S","display":false},{"tex":"L[A]","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}relative\\text{-}constructibility} \\vdash A\\subseteq\\operatorname{Ord}\\to\\forall x\\in V\\;\\left(\\mathrm{ZfcInner3RelativeConstructibleUniverse}_S(x,A)\\leftrightarrow\\exists\\alpha\\in V\\;(\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\land x\\in L_\\alpha[A])\\right)","display":true},{"tex":"L[A]=\\bigcup_{\\alpha\\in\\operatorname{Ord}}L_\\alpha[A]","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Ord}","display":false},{"tex":"L[A]","display":false}],"bytes":1430,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-4393","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-thm-relative-constructibility.md|58-thm-relative-constructibility]]（batch15）"}],"outgoing":["7fffbf0fc82b6138"]}